msgid "SquashFS"
msgstr "SquashFS"

msgid ""
"ReliefNT 默认内建 ``CONFIG_SQUASHFS=y``。它提供 SquashFS 4.0 只读挂载， 按需解压元数据、文件数据块和多个文件共享的 fragment "
"尾块。压缩算法包括 gzip、XZ、Zstandard、LZ4、LZO 和旧版 LZMA，也可以读取未压缩的数据块。 "
"目录、稀疏文件、软硬链接、文件权限及数字属主和属组使用镜像中保存的值。 Linux 路径和目录接口支持最长 255 字节的文件名。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefNT builds in ``CONFIG_SQUASHFS=y`` by default. It mounts SquashFS 4.0 images read-only "
"and decompresses metadata, file data blocks, and fragment blocks shared by file tails on "
"demand. It reads gzip, XZ, Zstandard, LZ4, LZO, and legacy LZMA compression as well as "
"uncompressed data blocks. Directory entries, sparse files, symbolic and hard links, file "
"permissions, and numeric user and group IDs are taken from the image. The Linux path and "
"directory interfaces support filenames up to 255 bytes long."

msgid "制作和挂载镜像"
msgstr "Creating and mounting an image"

msgid "在宿主机生成兼容镜像（``staging`` 为要打包的目录）::"
msgstr "Create a compatible image on the host, where ``staging`` is the directory to package::"

msgid ""
"将镜像放在来宾可访问的块设备或 GPT 分区上，再使用 ``mount -t squashfs -o ro`` 挂载。引导器以 ``reliefos-installer-"
"payload`` 为名称提供 Multiboot2 模块时， 内核将其注册为只读 ``/dev/ram1``。"
msgstr ""
"Place the image on a block device or GPT partition accessible to the guest, then mount it "
"with ``mount -t squashfs -o ro``. When the bootloader supplies a Multiboot2 module named "
"``reliefos-installer-payload``, the kernel registers it as the read-only device "
"``/dev/ram1``."

msgid "扩展属性"
msgstr "Extended attributes"

msgid ""
"``getxattr(2)`` 和 ``listxattr(2)`` 以及它们的 ``l*``、``f*`` 变体可以读取 内联属性值和外置的共享属性值。支持 "
"``user.*``、``trusted.*`` 和 ``security.*`` 命名空间。``user.*`` 属性读取遵循文件的读权限，``trusted.*`` 仅对具有 "
"``CAP_SYS_ADMIN`` 的调用者可见。设置或删除属性返回 ``EROFS``。"
msgstr ""
"``getxattr(2)`` and ``listxattr(2)``, including their ``l*`` and ``f*`` variants, can read "
"inline attribute values and shared values stored out of line. The ``user.*``, ``trusted.*``, "
"and ``security.*`` namespaces are supported. Reading ``user.*`` attributes follows the file "
"read permission. ``trusted.*`` is visible only to callers with ``CAP_SYS_ADMIN``. Setting or "
"removing attributes returns ``EROFS``."

msgid "使用边界"
msgstr "Scope of support"

msgid ""
"当前内核通过块设备读取镜像。loop 块设备、NFS 导出和 POSIX ACL 仍需要相应的 内核支持。``security.*`` 在这里是可读取的镜像元数据。读取标签不会启用 "
"SELinux 策略或基于文件属性的权限授予。ReliefNT 私有目录接口保留原有的固定结构大小。"
msgstr ""
"The kernel reads images through block devices. Loop devices, NFS export, and POSIX ACLs "
"require separate kernel support. ``security.*`` is exposed as readable image metadata. "
"Reading a label does not activate SELinux policy or grant privileges based on file "
"attributes. ReliefNT-specific directory interfaces retain their fixed structure size."
